      "writtenOn": "2019-07-25T00:10:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since these are hosted under common/usbc, how about the following?\n\n  usb_sm.o -\u003e usb_state_machine.o\n  usb_tc_sm.o -\u003e tcpm_task.o (or just tcpm.o)\n  usb_prl_sm.o -\u003e pd_protocol.o\n  usb_pe_ctvpd_sm.o -\u003e ct_vpd_policy_engine.o\n  usb_tc_vpd_sm.o -\u003e vpd.o\n  usb_tc_ctvpd_sm.o -\u003e ct_vpd.o\n  usb_tc_drp_acc_trysrc_sm.o -\u003e drp_accessory_try_src.o\n\nI don\u0027t think we need to explicitly say _sm.",
      "parentUuid": "1bad4254_a1aa2d0f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 139,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 146,
        "endChar": 51
